    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21445" root="سيف" body-key="s">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتِياَفٌ</span></b>  signifies The act of [<i>putting to the
sword,</i>] <i>destroying,</i> or <i>killing.</i> (KL.) One says,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اُسْتِيفَ القَوْمُ</span> [app. meaning <i>The people,</i> or <i>party,
were put to the sword</i>]: (K:) a phrase mentioned
by Lth. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 6.

